{"id":"9af2e908dee7a1f1","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LValueOpen.md","title":"LValueOpen","display":"LValueOpen","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"LValueOpen","parameters":["t"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"LValueOpen"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>t</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：指标替换与规约。有序参数：<code>t</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ LValueOpen t)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ AnyRaw t)\n  (or (exists n (@ TVar n t)) (or (exists b (@ ULam b t)) (exists a (exists b (@ TLam a b t))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"487e9a7343d4d692\" href=\"?note=487e9a7343d4d692\" title=\"ZFC_AnyRaw\">AnyRaw</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" href=\"?note=59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" title=\"ZFC_TLam\">TLam</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"00213bb93d499434\" href=\"?note=00213bb93d499434\" title=\"ZFC_TVar\">TVar</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f077e9016ad9f66b\" href=\"?note=f077e9016ad9f66b\" title=\"ZFC_ULam\">ULam</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ LValueOpen t)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_AnyRaw","status":"resolved","id":"487e9a7343d4d692","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_TLam","status":"resolved","id":"59c4a3ef7b6eaded","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_TVar","status":"resolved","id":"00213bb93d499434","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_ULam","status":"resolved","id":"f077e9016ad9f66b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":867,"backlinks":[{"id":"32a4962f5a4c639d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_LReachCBV|LReachCBV]]；[[ZFC_LValueOpen|LValueOpen]]"},{"id":"1b2e9f6ae1c2ae24","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_LInst|LInst]]；[[ZFC_LValueOpen|LValueOpen]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-337","locations":["正